\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Important Principles\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls12\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The model must preserve alignment.
\f1\b0  The founder's knowledge comes from internal alignment\'97his own healing journey walking in forests, learning to listen to what his body and the season need. If the system becomes fast and efficient but loses the 
\f2\i presence
\f1\i0  and 
\f2\i listening
\f1\i0 , it betrays the founder's values. The system should support the founder's work, not replace the care it requires.\
\ls12\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Authenticity cannot be mechanized.
\f1\b0  Customers stay because they sense genuine understanding, not because they received a recipe. The model can help organize and scale the 
\f2\i logic
\f1\i0 , but the founder's presence\'97attention, care, real listening\'97remains irreplaceable. The system must know its limits.\
\ls12\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The model serves the founder, not the reverse.
\f1\b0  If the system makes recommendations the founder wouldn't make, it fails\'97not just operationally, but philosophically.\
\ls12\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Transparency > Black box.
\f1\b0  The system should explain 
\f2\i why
\f1\i0  it recommends a mushroom + herb pairing (seasonal, flavor profile, body effect, sense match), not just output a recipe. This transparency honors the founder's knowledge and helps users understand the thinking.\
\ls12\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Seasonality and presence are built-in.
\f1\b0  The system must remain alive to seasonal change, local conditions, and new learning. It's not a static database; it's a living practice encoded.\
\ls12\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The philosophy is non-negotiable.
\f1\b0  Speed and scale matter only if they preserve what makes this business unique: personalization rooted in real understanding, grounded in the founder's journey of healing and growth.\
